# The application, as against the module. `beans.pot` cannot hold any of this:
# the compiler refuses a manifest row it does not know, which is the right rule
# and the reason this file exists beside it.
name       Markup
identifier org.beans-lang.cortado.markup

# This example keeps its markup in `site/`, which predates the scaffolder's
# `screens/` — and it stays that way on purpose. The folder a screen lives in
# is the project's choice; a tool that only understood one name would be one
# more thing to rename on the way in.
markup     site
